tion:absolute;left:96px;bottom:48px;z-index:15;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;\n    font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#6a756a;\n  }\n  .foot .sep{width:1px;height:14px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.28);}\n  .page-no{\n    position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:46px;z-index:15;\n    font-family:var(--font-display);\n    font-size:20px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#5c665d;\n  }\n  .page-no .cur{color:#1B2620;font-weight:600;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-a\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-b\"></div>\n  <div class=\"soft-prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"tick\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">溪木咖啡品牌传播</div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta-right\">内部对齐 · 表达口径</div>\n  <div class=\"rail-index\">03</div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">EXPRESSION PRINCIPLES</div>\n\n  <!-- 标题区 -->\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    <div class=\"kicker\">\n      <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n      <span class=\"bar\"></span>\n      <span>表达原则</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"page-title\">表达原则</h1>\n    <div class=\"title-rule\"></div>\n    <p class=\"lead\">以定位关键词“日常、友好、易理解”为基准，约定可复用的表达方式。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 口号卡 -->\n  <div class=\"slogan-card\">\n    <div class=\"slogan-label\">品牌口号 · 原样复用</div>\n    <div class=\"slogan\">“把日常慢慢喝好”</div>\n    <div class=\"slogan-note\">全篇统一使用此句，<b>不作改写</b>。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 四条原则 -->\n  <div class=\"principles\">\n\n    <div class=\"pr\">\n      <div class=\"idx\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"head\">\n          <div class=\"h\">口号原样复用，不作改写</div>\n          <span class=\"chip green\">统一口径</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d\">建议各表达位统一使用 <span class=\"em\">“把日常慢慢喝好”</span>，不作改写。</div>\n        <div class=\"src\">说明：本条为统一口径建议，原文仅给出品牌口号，未规定改写限制。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pr\">\n      <div class=\"idx\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"head\">\n          <div class=\"h\">用词贴近“日常”，避免生硬术语</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d\">优先使用贴近日常的场景语汇，回避生硬术语与抽象表述。</div>\n        <div class=\"src\">说明：本条由定位关键词推导，原文未逐条细化。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pr\">\n      <div class=\"idx\">03</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"head\">\n          <div class=\"h\">语气“友好”，信息“易理解”</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d\">一句话说清一件事，不做多层信息堆叠。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pr\">\n      <div class=\"idx\">04</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"head\">\n          <div class=\"h\">涉及数字须标注“仅供测评”</div>\n          <span class=\"chip\">仅供测评</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d\">出现数字时须标注“仅供测评”，<span class=\"em\">不得当作成果表述</span>。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 页脚 -->\n  <div class=\"foot\">\n    <span>资料依据：brand.docx（虚构测评材料）</span>\n    <span class=\"sep\"></span>\n    <span>数字口径：仅供测评</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\"><span class=\"cur\">3</span> / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"I need to output the full HTML with only the modification to item 01: change the description text and add a source note line.\n\nThe chip \"统一口径\" — should I keep it? Instruction says only adjust the fact labeling of item 01, change the sentence and add a small note line. Keep chip. But chip \"统一口径\" might be fine to keep since not instructed to change. I'll keep it.\n\nAdd `<div class=\"src\">说明：本条为统一口径建议，原文仅给出品牌口号，未规定改写限制</div>`.\n\nNeed to check layout height: principles area is flex column, 4 items flex:1 in 790px height → each ~197px. Adding a line to item 01 may overflow. Item 03 has head + d only; item 02 has head+d+src. So height fits with src. Item 01 will now have head+chip, d, src — similar to item 02. Probably fine given flex:1 distributes equally, content ~ 30*1.35 + 12 + 19*1.75 + 10 + 15*1.6 ≈ 40+12+33+10+24 = 119 + padding-top 26 = 145 < 197. OK.\n\nAlso the slogan card note says \"全篇统一使用此句，不作改写\" — instruction says don't change other content. Hmm, that's arguably a fact issue but instruction says only adjust item 01. Keep.\n\nOutput full HTML only."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10454,"completion_tokens":4408,"total_tokens":14862,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5888},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":315},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5888,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4566},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}